...you gotta think over and over again
about all the things you hate about her.

1204
01:46:56.428 --> 01:46:57.923
She's mean to you.

1205
01:46:58.097 --> 01:46:59.721
Never proud of you.

1206
01:47:00.349 --> 01:47:03.266
Never comes to watch
your hockey games.

1207
01:47:03.978 --> 01:47:06.303
Leaves you hungry,
never buys you clothes.

1208
01:47:06.480 --> 01:47:08.307
I'm not stupid.

1209
01:47:08.482 --> 01:47:12.314
- I know what you're doing.
- What's that?

1210
01:47:15.656 --> 01:47:17.779
I know she does all those things.

1211
01:47:20.327 --> 01:47:21.703
Yeah.

1212
01:47:21.870 --> 01:47:24.159
But you hate her anyway.

1213
01:47:24.331 --> 01:47:25.612
Yeah.

1214
01:47:25.791 --> 01:47:27.867
I hate her guts.

1215
01:47:28.043 --> 01:47:30.083
Well, you're lucky.

1216
01:47:30.254 --> 01:47:34.252
She never gave up on you
as quick as you're giving up on her.

1217
01:47:35.134 --> 01:47:37.422
When she was a bit older
than you are now...

1218
01:47:37.594 --> 01:47:40.595
...she got pregnant in a way
nobody should get pregnant.

1219
01:47:42.349 --> 01:47:44.508
Would've been a lot easier...

1220
01:47:44.685 --> 01:47:46.345
...to give you up to someone else.

1221
01:47:46.520 --> 01:47:50.849
Nobody would've blamed her if she did,
but she didn't. She stuck by you.

1222
01:47:51.025 --> 01:47:53.183
And she's still sticking by you...

1223
01:47:53.360 --> 01:47:55.982
...even though she knows you hate her.

1224
01:47:56.155 --> 01:47:58.028
She's still there waiting...

1225
01:47:59.199 --> 01:48:01.607
...hoping you'll get your ass home.

1226
01:48:06.540 --> 01:48:09.031
- Take it.
- What?

1227
01:48:09.835 --> 01:48:13.169
Well, if you wanna run off,
you can sell it and use the money.

1228
01:48:13.339 --> 01:48:16.339
Or just put it on your wrist.

1229
01:48:16.508 --> 01:48:18.715
Either way, it's yours.

1230
01:48:20.179 --> 01:48:22.255
One friend to another.

1231
01:48:34.943 --> 01:48:37.316
Karen, go to bed.

1232
01:48:37.905 --> 01:48:39.981
I'll wake you when he comes back.

1233
01:48:40.532 --> 01:48:42.324
It's me.

1234
01:49:12.272 --> 01:49:14.645
I didn't want you, Sammy.

1235
01:49:17.694 --> 01:49:21.858
Something bad had happened to me,
and I just wanted it to be over.

1236
01:49:24.368 --> 01:49:28.496
But every day my belly grew,
and it just reminded me of it.

1237
01:49:32.292 --> 01:49:36.076
Never even occurred to me
that there was a baby in there.

1238
01:49:38.549 --> 01:49:40.707
That you were in there.

1239
01:49:46.932 --> 01:49:49.886
That day, what that man did to me...

1240
01:49:53.188 --> 01:49:55.514
...it made me into something different.

1241
01:49:55.691 --> 01:49:57.315
And I guess...

1242
01:50:00.154 --> 01:50:02.645
I guess I thought...

1243
01:50:02.823 --> 01:50:06.073
...it said something about
who you were too.

1244
01:50:07.953 --> 01:50:11.156
I was a girl who was raped,
and you were this...

1245
01:50:11.331 --> 01:50:12.826
...thing...

1246
01:50:13.667 --> 01:50:16.158
...that just kept reminding me of it.

1247
01:50:20.340 --> 01:50:24.504
Oh, God, I've dreaded this conversation
since the day you were born.

1248
01:50:27.473 --> 01:50:30.343
I don't want any more secrets
between us.

1249
01:50:38.692 --> 01:50:40.435
This one night...

1250
01:50:41.778 --> 01:50:44.104
...I was lying in bed...

1251
01:50:44.948 --> 01:50:47.155
...and you moved inside me...

1252
01:50:47.534 --> 01:50:52.410
...like this tiny little butterfly,
just fluttering around in there.

1253
01:50:54.708 --> 01:50:57.116
And all of a sudden, I realized...

1254
01:50:58.045 --> 01:51:00.037
I just knew...

1255
01:51:01.048 --> 01:51:03.455
I knew you weren't his.

1256
01:51:04.885 --> 01:51:07.043
You were mine.

1257
01:51:07.221 --> 01:51:09.712
You were my baby.

1258
01:51:10.390 --> 01:51:12.217
And we were gonna be in it together.

1259
01:51:13.060 --> 01:51:15.218
Just the two of us.

1260
01:51:20.317 --> 01:51:23.816
You had nothing to do with that
ugliness, you hear me? Nothing.

1261
01:51:28.242 --> 01:51:32.156
And there's nothing in this world
I wouldn't do to be your mom.

1262
01:52:00.774 --> 01:52:02.601
I should've told you.

1263
01:52:07.948 --> 01:52:09.656
It's over, isn't it?

1264
01:52:12.786 --> 01:52:14.328
Not yet.

1265
01:52:24.256 --> 01:52:28.088
Mr. Sharp, do you know the difference
between consensual sex and rape?

1266
01:52:28.260 --> 01:52:29.802
Oh, yeah.

1267
01:52:29.970 --> 01:52:32.508
But when you're having a good time
like she was...

1268
01:52:32.681 --> 01:52:34.887
...ain't no rape. That's for damn sure.

1269
01:52:37.019 --> 01:52:39.058
Are you a virgin?

1270
01:52:39.229 --> 01:52:41.851
- No. I ain't a virgin.
- Objection, Your Honor. Relevance?

1271
01:52:42.024 --> 01:52:46.484
She can ask about my client's sexual
history, but I can't ask this witness?

1272
01:52:46.653 --> 01:52:48.610
No, you can't. Sustained.

1273
01:52:48.780 --> 01:52:50.773
- Why didn't you help her?
- Objection.

1274
01:52:50.949 --> 01:52:52.408
You saw Josey being attacked.

1275
01:52:52.576 --> 01:52:54.983
Miss Aimes' testimony has not been
corroborated by evidence.

1276
01:52:55.162 --> 01:52:58.531
Neither has his. And my client
would like to prove that he's lying.

1277
01:52:58.707 --> 01:53:00.498
I'm allowing it. For now.

1278
01:53:02.294 --> 01:53:03.705
Bobby?

1279
01:53:03.879 --> 01:53:07.579
When you saw Josey being attacked,
why didn't you help her?

1280
01:53:07.758 --> 01:53:11.209
You know, you can use
all the lawyer mumbo-jumbo you want...

1281
01:53:11.386 --> 01:53:15.004
...this still was no attack.
- I asked around about you, Bobby.

1282
01:53:15.182 --> 01:53:16.510
Folks say you're kind of soft.

1283
01:53:16.683 --> 01:53:19.470
Anyone that said that ain't man
enough to say it to my face.

1284
01:53:19.645 --> 01:53:21.471
Are you a red-ice player, then?

1285
01:53:22.856 --> 01:53:24.683
- How's that?
- I had a coach used to say:

1286
01:53:24.858 --> 01:53:27.693
"Win or lose,
leave your blood on the ice."

1287
01:53:28.195 --> 01:53:29.653
Good coach.

1288
01:53:29.821 --> 01:53:31.066
Yeah.

1289
01:53:31.239 --> 01:53:33.362
You're what coach would call...

1290
01:53:33.533 --> 01:53:35.028
...a yellow-ice player.

1291
01:53:35.202 --> 01:53:37.527
The kind that wets his pants
when things get rough.

1292
01:53:37.704 --> 01:53:39.780
- Objection. Argumentative.
- Denied.

1293
01:53:39.956 --> 01:53:43.871
She was your friend. You watched
him put his filthy hands on her...

1294
01:53:44.044 --> 01:53:46.202
...and you ran away.

1295
01:53:46.380 --> 01:53:48.040
- It wasn't like that.
- Your Honor.

1296
01:53:48.215 --> 01:53:50.088
- Sustained. Mr. White...
- What was it like then?

1297
01:53:50.258 --> 01:53:51.753
He held her down,
spread her legs...

1298
01:53:51.927 --> 01:53:54.548
...jammed himself up inside her..?
- Mr. White!

1299
01:53:56.556 --> 01:53:59.344
Rangers are hard as steel, huh?

1300
01:54:00.435 --> 01:54:02.060
Not this one.

1301
01:54:02.229 --> 01:54:04.056
This one's made of butter.

1302
01:54:05.107 --> 01:54:08.855
You gonna keep lying about your friend,
or you gonna stand up and be a man?

1303
01:54:09.027 --> 01:54:10.486
- Objection.
- I'm not lying.

1304
01:54:10.654 --> 01:54:12.812
- You wanna run right now, don't you?
- Fuck you.

1305
01:54:12.989 --> 01:54:14.649
- All right. That's enough.
- You wanna run?

1306
01:54:14.825 --> 01:54:18.609
- I didn't run.
- Or you gonna put your guts on the ice?

1307
01:54:18.787 --> 01:54:20.993
What's it gonna be? Yellow?

1308
01:54:21.415 --> 01:54:22.992
Or red?

1309
01:54:23.417 --> 01:54:25.243
Yellow or red?

1310
01:54:26.336 --> 01:54:29.871
- Yellow or red?!
- What was I supposed to do?!

1311
01:54:38.056 --> 01:54:39.716
He was raping her, wasn't he?

1312
01:54:44.813 --> 01:54:46.272
Yeah.

1313
01:54:50.110 --> 01:54:51.770
And you ran.

1314
01:54:54.823 --> 01:54:56.614
What was I supposed to do?

1315
01:55:04.291 --> 01:55:06.200
What are you supposed to do...

1316
01:55:06.376 --> 01:55:11.667
...when the ones with all the power
are hurting those with none?

1317
01:55:14.968 --> 01:55:17.459
Well, for starters, you stand up.

1318
01:55:18.930 --> 01:55:21.504
You stand up and tell the truth.

1319
01:55:22.225 --> 01:55:23.933
You stand up...

1320
01:55:24.478 --> 01:55:25.972
...for your friends.

1321
01:55:26.146 --> 01:55:29.182
- Objection, Your Honor.
- You stand up...

1322
01:55:29.357 --> 01:55:31.231
...even when you're all alone.

1323
01:55:33.487 --> 01:55:35.526
- You stand up.
- All right.

1324
01:55:35.697 --> 01:55:37.939
- Mr. White, if you are through...
- Excuse me.

1325
01:55:38.116 --> 01:55:39.741
What is going on back there?

1326
01:55:40.994 --> 01:55:43.319
This is Glory.

1327
01:55:44.623 --> 01:55:47.292
She worked at Pearson's.

1328
01:55:48.001 --> 01:55:49.709
She wants to say:

1329
01:55:51.963 --> 01:55:55.249
"My name is Glory Dodge.

1330
01:55:56.301 --> 01:55:58.507
And I'm not fucking dead yet.

1331
01:55:59.346 --> 01:56:01.588
I stand with Josey."

1332
01:56:14.277 --> 01:56:15.309
Your Honor?

1333
01:56:15.487 --> 01:56:17.361
Your Honor said
we need three plaintiffs.

1334
01:56:17.531 --> 01:56:18.610
It's still only two.

1335
01:58:13.605 --> 01:58:15.064
Ready?

1336
01:58:16.650 --> 01:58:18.227
Yeah!

1337
01:58:18.401 --> 01:58:19.646
Nice.

1338
01:58:23.239 --> 01:58:25.647
- Yeah!
- Oh, yeah!

1339
01:58:30.830 --> 01:58:33.452
Hey, your son was just telling me
how rich you guys are now.

1340
01:58:34.834 --> 01:58:36.874
- Oh, really?
- You gonna buy me a car?

1341
01:58:37.045 --> 01:58:40.331
- No. You're not old enough to drive yet.
- So?

1342
01:58:58.817 --> 01:59:00.809
Why are we stopping?

1343
01:59:00.986 --> 01:59:04.319
Well, if you want a car someday,
you gotta know how to drive it, right?

1344
01:59:04.489 --> 01:59:05.900
First lesson:

1345
01:59:06.074 --> 01:59:08.446
Driver sits behind the wheel.

1346
01:59:09.202 --> 01:59:11.029
Come on, move your butt.

1347
01:59:13.123 --> 01:59:14.700
Seat belt.

1348
01:59:15.458 --> 01:59:17.250
All right.

1349
01:59:17.419 --> 01:59:18.961
- What do I do?
- Okay.

1350
01:59:19.129 --> 01:59:22.295
Put your foot on the accelerator.
Gently, okay?

1351
01:59:22.465 --> 01:59:25.039
And stay on the road if you can.

1352
01:59:26.219 --> 01:59:27.713
Go on, go on.

1353
01:59:30.557 --> 01:59:34.554
All right. Let's take a tiny
little bit at a time. Okay.

1354
01:59:34.728 --> 01:59:36.388
Slow down.

1355
01:59:36.563 --> 01:59:39.268
Slow down, racecar driver.

1356
01:59:40.066 --> 01:59:43.233
There you go. You're a natural.
